IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDECODE-MICROBATCH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ACTIVE-SEQUENCES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MICRO-BATCH-SIZE    PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 MICRO-BATCHES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDECODE.
    IF MICRO-BATCH-SIZE == 0
        MOVE 4 TO MICRO-BATCH-SIZE.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE MICRO-BATCHES = (ACTIVE-SEQUENCES + MICRO-BATCH-SIZE - 1) / MICRO-BATCH-SIZE.
    IF MICRO-BATCHES == 0
        MOVE 1 TO MICRO-BATCHES.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 MICRO-BATCHES.
    WEIGHT 30 MICRO-BATCH-SIZE.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
